# custom/002/CmnDefRelicWeapon050Trade_00221
msgid ""
msgstr ""
"Language: ru\n"
"Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8\n"
"X-Game-Version: 2026.09.15.0000.0000\n"
"X-Source-Language: en\n"

#. ja: 「ゾディアックウェポン」を作るための準備が整ったようだな。<br>さぁ、さっそく再創造を行おうではないか！
#. de: Du bist bereit für unseren Rekonstruktionsversuch? Dann sollten wir sofort zur Tat schreiten!
#. fr: Gerolt est prêt à forger notre arme du zodiaque<nbsp>? Parfait<nbsp>! C'est exactement ce que je voulais entendre.
msgctxt "custom/002/CmnDefRelicWeapon050Trade_00221:TEXT_CMNDEFRELICWEAPON050TRADE_00221_JALZAHN_000_000:1"
msgid "You are ready to recreate a legendary arm from times of eld? Then let us make the soul of your current relic ascend to a new-forged vessel, and so remake a...a Zodiac Weapon!"
msgstr ""

#. ja: この「ゾディアックウェポン」は、かような力を持つであろう！<br>決意が揺らがぬようであれば、さっそく再創造の作業に入るぞ！
#. de: Ich kann es gar nicht erwarten, die Zodiak-Waffe mit eigenen Augen zu sehen, geschweige denn, sie in meinen Händen zu halten - das Prickeln ihrer Kraft zu spüren, ihr Licht zu sehen! Wohlan!
#. fr: Si vous êtes toujours décidé<if $gn4>e</if> à aller au bout de cette folle aventure, je vous propose de commencer sans plus attendre.
msgctxt "custom/002/CmnDefRelicWeapon050Trade_00221:TEXT_CMNDEFRELICWEAPON050TRADE_00221_JALZAHN_000_001:1"
msgid "Yes, the Zodiac Weapon we make with these will be finer than aught else in the land. If you are firm in your purpose, let us begin!"
msgstr ""

#. ja: 再創造する「ゾディアックウェポン」を選択してください
#. de: Welche Zodiak-Waffe möchtest du rekonstruieren?
#. fr: Choisissez l'arme du zodiaque que vous voulez forger
msgctxt "custom/002/CmnDefRelicWeapon050Trade_00221:TEXT_CMNDEFRELICWEAPON050TRADE_00221_MENU_TITLE:1"
msgid "What Zodiac Weapon would you like to recreate?"
msgstr ""

#. ja: <if ($n1 == 9491)>「<sheet Item 8649 0>」から「<sheet Item 9491 0>」、「<sheet Item 8658 0>」から「<sheet Item 9500 0>」を再創造<else>「<sheet Item $n2 0>」から「<sheet Item $n1 0>」を再創造</if>
#. de: <if ($n1 == 9491)><capitalize><noun-de Item 5 9491 1 4 1></capitalize> aus <noun-de Item 5 8649 1 3 1> und <noun-de Item 1 9500 1 4 1> aus <noun-de Item 2 8658 1 3 1> rekonstruieren<else><capitalize><noun-de Item 1 $n1 1 4 1></capitalize> aus <noun-de Item 2 $n2 1 3 1> rekonstruieren</if>
#. fr: <if ($n1 == 9491)>Transformer <noun-fr Item 12 8649 1 1> en <noun-fr Item 12 9491 1 1> et <noun-fr Item 2 8658 1 1> en <noun-fr Item 12 9500 1 1><else>Transformer <noun-fr Item 2 $n2 1 1> en <noun-fr Item 12 $n1 1 1></if>
#. macro: <if ($n1 == 9491)><sheet Item 9491 9> (<sheet Item 8649 9>) and <sheet Item 9500 9> (<sheet Item 8658 9>)<else><capitalize><sheet Item $n1 9></capitalize> (<cap… — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = number parameter 1 == 9491 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <sheet Item 9491 9> — a value from a game data sheet, such as a name; sheet = Item, row = 9491, column = 9 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
